@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
autonumber
title UC-01 / UC-08 | child access and recovery (mechanism TBD)
actor Child
participant "Child app" as App
participant "Identity / session module" as Identity
database "Learner store" as DB
Child -> App : Open app
alt Valid scoped credential exists
 App -> Identity : Validate / renew scoped access
 Identity -> DB : Check learner scope and revocation
 Identity --> App : Authorized learner context
else New profile
 App -> Identity : Establish access using selected guest/account method
 note over App, Identity
 OQ-01: method and required credentials are not selected.
 No second-person account or device approval.
 end note
 Identity -> DB : Create independent learner identity idempotently
 Identity --> App : Scoped session
 Child -> App : Choose age band and character options
 App -> Identity : Save own profile configuration
 Identity -> DB : Validate scope and persist
else Existing profile, credential lost / expired
 App -> Identity : Use selected recovery mechanism
 alt Recovery verified
  Identity -> DB : Resolve same learner; apply session policy
  Identity --> App : Restored authorized access
 else Proof unavailable / invalid
  Identity --> App : Explain recovery limits; no private data
 end
end
opt Authorized context established
 App -> Identity : Fetch own confirmed progress
 Identity -> DB : Scope-check and read
 Identity --> App : Own profile and confirmed checkpoint
 App --> Child : Enter or resume map
end
note over App, DB
Nickname or avatar is never proof of identity.
Unsynced data from a lost device may not be recoverable.
end note
@enduml
